@startuml SEQUENCE
title School Facility Rental - Sequence
actor Renter
participant Website
participant "School Staff" as Staff
participant "Payment Service" as Pay
participant "Email Service" as Email
Renter -> Website: submit request
... Checking availability ...
Website -> Staff: send request for review
... Reviewing request ...
alt approved
Staff --> Website: approved
Pay --> Renter
... add payment and confirmation ...
else payment success 
Website --> Renter: Booking saved
... Sending confirmation email ...
else payment failure 
Website --> Renter: Failure recorded
... Sending failure email ...
else rejected
Staff --> Website: rejected
Website --> Renter: Send email of rejection


end
@enduml